# M5 H directed probes, pass/fail on W2 and W4 (tohost 1 for the specified
# behaviour, 0xB000 + n for the old core's deviation Bn of appendix B): a
# store/AMO guest-page fault (B11), virtual-instruction traps in VU/VS (B23),
# htval/mtval2 and hstatus.SPVP on traps from V = 0 (B25), vsstatus.MXR and a
# CBO in the G-stage (B40), and the G-stage A/D update with the htinst/mtinst
# pseudoinstruction of an implicit VS-stage access (h_gad).
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
hprobe/b11_amo_gpf budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b11_amo_gpf.hex lockstep=0
hprobe/b23_vu_fence budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b23_vu_fence.hex lockstep=0
hprobe/b25_htval_spvp budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b25_htval_spvp.hex lockstep=0
hprobe/b40_mxr_cbo budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b40_mxr_cbo.hex lockstep=0
hprobe/h_gad budget=200000 hex=test/directed/h_gad.hex lockstep=0
